[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243200560","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109982#issuecomment-3243200560","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109982","id":3243200560,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BT1Aw","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T20:16:57Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T20:16:57Z","body":"Could this be fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108697?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243200560/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290309313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109982#issuecomment-3290309313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109982","id":3290309313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EHiLB","user":{"login":"Favkis","id":46406204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDA2MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46406204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis","html_url":"https://github.com/Favkis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Favkis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T02:59:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T03:04:43Z","body":"I am having awful time with godot 4.4.1 freezing and crashing on import/reimport of certain files (right now I am having it with .glb AnimationLibrary). However, it's inconsistent at all, so I cant even reproduce it, sometimes it does it 50 times in a row, sometimes it doesn't. Removing .godot folder fixes it once, but next import/reimport might break it. I dont have physics on separate thread enabled, however I did have physics interpolation on, and disabling it, looks like, fixed it, at least for now, but again, its super inconsistent, so I cant tell for sure. \n\n<img width=\"960\" height=\"221\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9b537d7-f967-49ef-a7ad-5456b13f6b8b\" />\n\nthis is what I was getting in console. \n\nMore info about how it looks:\n\n<img width=\"530\" height=\"132\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35cb89b2-2f8c-42c3-8559-50a5c91146fa\" />\n\nit would do this window or (Re)importing window, then freeze and memory would go up and up from 800 mb to around 2 GB RAM used, and then it just silently closes. Most of the times (or even all of them, I honestly couldnt tell), it actually reimports/imports, and looks like just UI bug. \n\n<img width=\"531\" height=\"126\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79995aa3-c707-4fed-b82c-f06ece312bc9\" />\n\nOther times, it would show this window forever, but wont go \"white\" as if its frozen, however, this window would be up and I cant press anything. However, if I press red X on windows to close editor, godot asks me to save scenes, and this window disappears, and I can semi use project again. Semi use because some buttons would break, like for example these instead of toggling windows, would just get pressed and get highlighed and do nothing. \n\n<img width=\"364\" height=\"106\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1fd3c44-9906-40b7-b8e4-e9b17deb71d2\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290309313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290347453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109982#issuecomment-3290347453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109982","id":3290347453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EHre9","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T03:28:19Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T03:28:19Z","body":"@Favkis @MbsElectronics could you both test with 4.5 RC2? This issue may have been fixed in 4.5 already","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290347453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3598770231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109982#issuecomment-3598770231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109982","id":3598770231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WgOA3","user":{"login":"greenpixels","id":58704291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzA0Mjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58704291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels","html_url":"https://github.com/greenpixels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.co